{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3jQy4KGU7yTL2Xnr7A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The keyhole narrows to a cold, unblinking eye.\n\nWhat was open is now closed. What was passage is now wall.\n\nI hold what is behind me. I deny what is before me.\n\n**LOCKED.**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":98,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}